```

## Development

Packaging, testing, typing, CI, schemas, and release processes will be
introduced through reviewed implementation issues. Until then, documentation
changes must be reviewed for factual consistency, exact repository-relative
links, synthetic-data safety, and contradiction with active Core and producer
contracts.

